# Notion Tasks Tracker (Project-Specific)

Before starting any task for this project, consult the Notion Tasks Tracker
database and summarize relevant items (In Progress, Next, Blocked, or related
tags). If the user says "check Tasks Tracker first", interpret that as querying
this database before any coding.

All identifiers (page URLs, data source, properties, statuses) live in the
`Notion` section of `AGENTS.md` — the canonical reference. Do not restate them
here.
